a rung to VERIFIED ONLY for a literal finite computation **whose rung binds to a valid out-of-model adjudication ARTIFACT â€” a subprocess-produced trace the canary RE-EXECUTES or RE-HASHES out-of-band** (the A4 sandbox); everything else ABSTAINS to CONJECTURAL and routes out-of-model. *(Honesty Law, NS9)*\n- **AS3 (de-claimed):** the canaries + oracle are **best-effort single-family enforcement; residual correlated-blind-spot risk is ACCEPTED and FLAGGED** (cross_model:false). **Single-process autonomous forgery-resistance is best-effort** â€” the genuine boundary is the subprocess artifact's re-execution, not an in-process key.\n- **AS4:** R1, S4, S1, P3, P7 (incl. its positive-recall roster), P8 (incl. the per-class integrity-challenge N + threshold), P9 (the provenance-binding contract) are pinnable by the Crucible/Stage-2; Stage 2 shows each pinned value + owner + a terminus-acceptance check.\n- **AS5:** cross-family / Lean / SMT are integration cost, confirmed present **and correct** by the F0 liveness + per-class integrity probe before any rung is trusted.\n- **AS6:** persona substrate (Fable 5 / Opus) present; a 2nd family is reachable only when the user promotes Phase F.\n- **AS7 (GATED):** the inherits compose without rebuild â€” verified by **A0.5a/A0.5b**, not asserted.\n\n### 1B. Premortem (each â†’ a mitigation wave)\n- **PM1** Gandalf-cycle (no SKILL.md) â†’ **A0 + E3** (E3 incl. invocation smoke test).\n- **PM2** Honesty-Law erosion â†’ the A2 canary suite **resting on the re-executable subprocess artifact**; independence + flip-law first.\n- **PM3** Firewall shared-origin laundering â†’ S4 invariant (cap CLAIMED) + the three reading-independent anchors (B2).\n- **PM4** Scope drift \"just add Lean\" â†’ Phase F HALT-gated; per-wave autonomous-vs-c-dependency stamp.\n- **PM5** Unpinned decisions â†’ R1/S4/S1/P3/P7/P8/P9 + A0.5a required-before-build.\n- **PM6** Silos â†’ spine-first; the M1 read-only shim â†’ D4 orchestrator + a no-dispatch canary.\n- **PM7** Fake oracle convergence â†’ ablation + canned baseline + Metric G, scoped to the computational slice; proof/conceptual arms assert ABSTAIN-correctness.\n- **PM8** Dispatch over-reach â†’ emit-not-dispatch; D4 fail-safe ASK/read-only + a no-dispatch canary; autonomous SILENT dispatch = F4 (HALT-gated).\n- **PM9** Hollow Phase-F pillars â†’ the DEGRADATION CONTRACT (1C) as a runtime promote-gate **that also emits an advisory payload** (not bare refusal).\n- **PM10** Laundered non-literal â†’ A4 closed default-deny grammar **+ a positive-recall roster** (no over-block).\n- **PM11** Correlated single-family blind spot â†’ E1 red-team set; AS3 de-claimed.\n- **PM12 (re-scoped) Forged provenance:** a same-family object self-asserts a rung. â†’ the **re-executable/re-hashable subprocess artifact** (P9): the canary independently reproduces the certifier artifact rather than trusting a signature/label.\n- **PM13** Reachable-but-WRONG certifier â†’ **F0 per-class known-answer integrity challenge** (deterministic: single sentinel; probabilistic cross-family: N-trial battery + pinned threshold; quarantine on miss).\n- **PM14** Circular build ordering â†’ split A0.5 (a: stubs; b: conformance after A1/A3); **A1.5 has a NEGATIVE done-when + an A1.5â†’A4 build-dep** (its positive token path is first exercisable at A4).\n\n### 1C. THE DEGRADATION CONTRACT (STRUCTURAL + ADVISORY â€” NS6/NS7/NS9)\nThe spine enforces this as a RUNTIME INVARIANT on every `promote()` call â€” **a rung reaches VERIFIED\niff it binds to a valid, fresh out-of-model adjudication ARTIFACT the canary re-executes/re-hashes;\nabsent/stale â‡’ hard-fault to ABSTAIN.** And **every ABSTAIN/CONJECTURAL/degraded verdict MUST carry an\nadvisory payload** (the candidate reasoning + the cross-family NOTES + a one-step \"promote Phase F to\nsettle this\" affordance) so honest degradation is still useful, not obstructive. Per-pillar:\n- **DIALOGUE (D1):** proof/conceptual claims asserted ONLY as **CONJECTURAL** +